  "description": "this is the city of Astana. Main Features:\n\n* Population: about 1,200,000 (2023).\n* Geography: Located on the banks of the Ishim River in the northern part of Kazakhstan.\n* Climate: Continental, with cold winters and hot summers.\n* Economy: The center of financial, commercial and trade activities in Kazakhstan. \n* Culture: A mixture of traditions of the Kazakh people and modern architecture.\n* Architecture: Modern skyscrapers, mosques, museums and monuments.\n* Transport: Well-developed public transport infrastructure, including the metro.\n* Attractions: Baiterek, Palace of Peace and Accord, Hazret Sultan Mosque.",
